    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "对于存在多个幅值=1或-180°穿越的系统，标准伯德图稳定性判据不够明确，必须确定可能的幅值裕度（GM）和相角裕度（PM）值，然后回归奈奎斯特稳定性判据以获得准确的稳定裕度。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "For systems with multiple magnitude=1 or -180° crossovers, the standard Bode plot stability criteria are less clear, and one must determine possible GM and PM values and then revert to the Nyquist stability criterion for correct stability margins.",
